{"speciesId":474,"names":{"fr":"Porygon-Z","es":"Porygon-Z","en":"Porygon-Z","ja":"ポリゴンＺ"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error..."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error..."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"Il a été modifié pour être capable de travailler dans des dimensions parallèles, mais c’est un échec."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"Il a été modifié pour être capable de travailler dans des dimensions parallèles, mais c’est un échec."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"Its programming was modified to enable work in alien dimensions. It did not work as planned."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Un logiciel supplémentaire fut installé pour l’améliorer. Mais depuis, il se comporte bizarrement."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Se le instaló un software para mejorarlo. Sin embargo, comenzó a comportarse de manera extraña."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however."},{"language":"ja","version":"x","text":"より 優れた ポケモンに するため プログラムを 追加したが なぜか おかしな 行動を はじめた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"y","text":"On a modifié son programme pour qu’il puisse parcourir les dimensions, mais ce fut un échec."},{"language":"es","version":"y","text":"Aunque le instalaron un software para desplazarse por otras dimensiones, algo no funcionó bien."},{"language":"en","version":"y","text":"Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error..."},{"language":"ja","version":"y","text":"異次元空間を 自由に 移動できるように プログラムを 修正したが ミスした らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Un logiciel supplémentaire fut installé pour l’améliorer. Mais depuis, il se comporte bizarrement."},{"language":"es","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Se le instaló un software para mejorarlo. Sin embargo, comenzó a comportarse de manera extraña."},{"language":"en","version":"omega-ruby","text":"Additional software was installed to make it a better Pokémon. It began acting oddly, however."},{"language":"ja","version":"omega-ruby","text":"より 優れた ポケモンに するため プログラムを 追加したが なぜか おかしな 行動を はじめた。"},{"language":"fr","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"On a modifié son programme pour qu’il puisse parcourir les dimensions, mais ce fut un échec."},{"language":"es","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Aunque le instalaron un software para desplazarse por otras dimensiones, algo no funcionó bien."},{"language":"en","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"Its programming was modified to enable it to travel through alien dimensions. Seems there might have been an error..."},{"language":"ja","version":"alpha-sapphire","text":"異次元空間を 自由に 移動できるように プログラムを 修正したが ミスした らしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sun","text":"Il a été modifié pour devenir encore plus efficace, mais cela a entraîné plusieurs bugs. Maintenant, il se conduit très bizarrement."},{"language":"es","version":"sun","text":"Se le instaló un software para mejorarlo. Sin embargo, algo salió mal y a raíz de ello comenzó a comportarse de manera extraña."},{"language":"en","version":"sun","text":"In order to create a more advanced Pokémon, an additional program was installed, but apparently it contained a defect that makes it move oddly."},{"language":"ja","version":"sun","text":"さらに 優れた ポケモンを 目指し 追加した プログラムに 不具合が あったらしく 動きが おかしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"moon","text":"Un nouveau logiciel était censé lui permettre de voyager entre les dimensions, mais tout ne se passe pas comme prévu et il y a des bugs."},{"language":"es","version":"moon","text":"La actualización de software que recibió para viajar a otras dimensiones ha causado cambios extraños y llamativos en su comportamiento."},{"language":"en","version":"moon","text":"Its program was modified to facilitate extra-dimensional activities, but that led to noticeably strange behavior."},{"language":"ja","version":"moon","text":"異次元空間での 活動を 目指し プログラムを 更新したが おかしな 挙動が 目立つ。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Son comportement, manifestement étrange, s’expliquerait par l’incompétence du technicien qui a mis à jour son système d’exploitation."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Llama la atención por su errática conducta, la cual se debe a la torpeza de quien realizara la actualización de su sistema operativo."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-sun","text":"Its behavior is noticeably unstable, which is apparently due to the incompetence of the engineer who updated its programming."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-sun","text":"不安定な 挙動が 目立つ。 プログラムを アップデートした 技術者の 腕の せいらしい。"},{"language":"fr","version":"ultra-moon","text":"Le logiciel qu’on lui a implanté était de toute évidence défaillant. Il s’agit sans doute d’une expérience ratée, vu son étrange comportement."},{"language":"es","version":"ultra-moon","text":"El software que se le instaló era defectuoso. Tal vez se trate de un experimento fallido, a tenor de su extraño comportamiento."},{"language":"en","version":"ultra-moon","text":"A faulty update was added to its programming. Its behavior is noticeably strange, so the experiment may have been a failure."},{"language":"ja","version":"ultra-moon","text":"追加した プログラムが まずかった。 おかしな 挙動が 目立つので 実験失敗 なのかも しれない。"},{"language":"fr","version":"sword","text":"Depuis qu’on lui a ajouté un programme permettant de voyager entre les dimensions, son comportement est devenu instable."},{"language":"es","version":"sword","text":"Se le instaló un software que le permite entrar y salir de otras dimensiones, pero que provocó que su comportamiento se volviese inestable."},{"language":"en","version":"sword","text":"Porygon-Z had a program installed to allow it to move between dimensions, but the program also caused instability in Porygon-Z’s behavior."},{"language":"ja","version":"sword","text":"異次元 空間に 出入りできる プログラムを 追加したところ 挙動が 不安定になった。"},{"language":"fr","version":"shield","text":"On dit qu’un nouveau programme l’a fait évoluer, mais les avis des scientifiques divergent quant à savoir s’il s’agit réellement d’une évolution."},{"language":"es","version":"shield","text":"Se dice que evolucionó con la instalación de un nuevo software, pero la comunidad científica está dividida respecto a si es o no una evolución."},{"language":"en","version":"shield","text":"Some say an additional program made this Pokémon evolve, but even academics can’t agree on whether Porygon-Z is really an evolution."},{"language":"ja","version":"shield","text":"追加 プログラムで 進化したと 言われるが ほんとうに 進化なのか 学会でも 意見が 分かれる。"},{"language":"en","version":"legends-arceus","text":"A curious item induced this evolution. The Pokémon's offensive capabilities have greatly increased, but the strangeness of its behavior has magnified in equal measure. This worries me."}],"varieties":[{"id":474,"moves":[{"name":"tackle","learns":[[8,"level-up",1],[9,"level-up",1],[10,"level-up",1],[11,"level-up",